   "text": "I'm already getting into it."
  },
  {
   "start": 477.9,
   "end": 487.61,
   "text": "I wanted to finish my, um..."
  },
  {
   "start": 487.61,
   "end": 488.73,
   "text": "Wikipedia..."
  },
  {
   "start": 488.73,
   "end": 490.29,
   "text": "Calendar page."
  },
  {
   "start": 490.37,
   "end": 492.69,
   "text": "Because, uh..."
  },
  {
   "start": 492.69,
   "end": 495.73,
   "text": "It was still separated from the rest of my bi-weekly history tests."
  },
  {
   "start": 495.77,
   "end": 496.77,
   "text": "I wanted to get back in there."
  },
  {
   "start": 496.85,
   "end": 497.07,
   "text": "You know."
  },
  {
   "start": 497.15,
   "end": 498.43,
   "text": "Before I like lose it or whatever."
  },
  {
   "start": 498.61,
   "end": 499.29,
   "text": "And..."
  },
  {
   "start": 499.29,
   "end": 510.05,
   "text": "But I still had to figure out how long it was to read, um, all these, like, three months' worth."
  },
  {
   "start": 510.89,
   "end": 515.21,
   "text": "So, like, 100, like 90 of them and convert them with the month calculator."
  },
  {
   "start": 515.21,
   "end": 524.64,
   "text": "And then, and then I had to change the, um, the fonts on, like, three months' worth, too."
  },
  {
   "start": 526.46,
   "end": 527.66,
   "text": "And it just took forever."
  },
  {
   "start": 527.86,
   "end": 529.12,
   "text": "It was, like, a couple of hours."
  },
  {
   "start": 529.36,
   "end": 530.46,
   "text": "And I wasn't having fun."
  },
  {
   "start": 530.78,
   "end": 531.76,
   "text": "Which is a good sign."
  },
  {
   "start": 531.86,
   "end": 532.82,
   "text": "I shouldn't change years."
  },
  {
   "start": 532.82,
   "end": 533.34,
   "text": "Years."
  },
  {
   "start": 534.24,
   "end": 535.28,
   "text": "But I finished it."
  },
  {
   "start": 535.62,
   "end": 535.82,
   "text": "So."
  },
  {
   "start": 536.7,
   "end": 538.42,
   "text": "And, uh, today at 2.45."
  },
  {
   "start": 538.42,
   "end": 542.82,
   "text": "And then I got up this morning and it's, like, snowed like a foot."
  },
  {
   "start": 543.24,
   "end": 544.54,
   "text": "And there's still snowing."
  },
  {
   "start": 547.12,
   "end": 547.48,
   "text": "So."
  },
  {
   "start": 547.48,
   "end": 556.38,
   "text": "Uh, at 2.45 I'm going to go to the, um, my mom's house because she's going to go with me."
  },
  {
   "start": 556.44,
   "end": 560.28,
   "text": "She's going to accompany me because I don't like doing errands by myself."
  },
  {
   "start": 560.28,
   "end": 566.42,
   "text": "Well, we're used to doing errands together anyway because I didn't have a car and she'd have to take me around."
  },
  {
   "start": 567.18,
   "end": 574.04,
   "text": "But, um, anyway, um, we're going to go and get the, uh, plates for my car."
  },
  {
   "start": 574.04,
   "end": 582.46,
   "text": "And, uh, then it'll be, like, totally legal and then I can drive it."
  },
  {
   "start": 585.8,
   "end": 590.38,
   "text": "Um, maybe I'll drive it around town a little."
  },
  {
   "start": 590.52,
   "end": 590.88,
   "text": "I don't know."
  },
  {
   "start": 592.0,
   "end": 601.25,
   "text": "But, oh, but, uh, until then I think I might work on my, um, spiral dynamic page."
  },
  {
   "start": 601.31,
   "end": 606.33,
   "text": "I know that sounds kind of, uh, it's like, wait, didn't you say you were going to start exercising?"
  },
  {
   "start": 606.33,
   "end": 618.97,
   "text": "But the spiral dynamics page, um, like, I kind of just started it and there's this, uh, there's this generations cutout that I took from, uh, from this book."
  },
  {
   "start": 623.32,
   "end": 623.72,
   "text": "Generations."
  },
  {
   "start": 623.72,
   "end": 635.48,
   "text": "And, um, it has, like, the information of all the generations that I wanted to type it there."
  },
  {
   "start": 635.82,
   "end": 637.44,
   "text": "I put, it got, like, scratched."
  },
  {
   "start": 638.48,
   "end": 641.48,
   "text": "Poked holes in it by my, uh, ferrets."
  },
  {
   "start": 641.62,
   "end": 646.96,
   "text": "And so I put tape around it and I just wanted to type it in there as the one last thing and maybe work on it a couple hours."
  },
  {
   "start": 647.8,
   "end": 650.46,
   "text": "I guess, you know, kind of, like, ease into the exercise."
  },
  {
   "start": 650.66,
   "end": 653.0,
   "text": "You know, you think about it for a couple days and then you do it."
  },
  {
   "start": 653.0,
   "end": 657.44,
   "text": "Um, because, um, and then just, just get it up to snuff."
  },
  {
   "start": 657.52,
   "end": 668.58,
   "text": "Because when you first start a new page, the first day, the first 20, the first, yeah, like, the first day or maybe, like, 24 hours of working on it."
  },
  {
   "start": 668.62,
   "end": 670.26,
   "text": "So maybe the first two days or whatever."
  },
  {
   "start": 670.26,
   "end": 682.03,
   "text": "Um, this is, like, it's like a bell curve."
  },
  {
   "start": 682.17,
   "end": 687.27,
   "text": "It's where you're, like, almost vertical in exponential improvement."
  },
  {
   "start": 687.67,
   "end": 690.17,
   "text": "You know, like, you get it pretty much built in one day."
  },
  {
   "start": 690.21,
   "end": 694.42,
   "text": "And then everything after that is making it better."
  },
  {
   "start": 694.52,
   "end": 695.98,
   "text": "So you're kind of, like, designing it."
  },
  {
   "start": 696.02,
   "end": 700.72,
   "text": "And it's just, like, that's when I'm the most, like, addicted or something."
  },
  {
   "start": 700.86,
   "end": 703.02,
   "text": "It's, it's, it's the most, uh, effortless."
  },
  {
   "start": 703.02,
   "end": 706.04,
   "text": "It's, so if, whatever is effortless, you do."
  },
  {
   "start": 706.2,
   "end": 707.42,
   "text": "Like, that's what you do in life."
  },
  {
   "start": 707.5,
   "end": 711.52,
   "text": "You do whatever is the most effortless thing at that moment in time."
  },
  {
   "start": 711.58,
   "end": 712.28,
   "text": "That's the ideal."
  },
  {
   "start": 714.26,
   "end": 717.72,
   "text": "And so, yeah, I think I'm going to go and just type that in."
  },
  {
   "start": 717.92,
   "end": 719.16,
   "text": "And I'll see how I feel."
  },
  {
   "start": 720.22,
   "end": 725.3,
   "text": "Okay, I, because I was really tedious."
  },
  {
   "start": 726.28,
   "end": 729.66,
   "text": "I wasn't, you know, I was like, I'm done with doing it like this much."
  },
  {
   "start": 729.66,
   "end": 734.5,
   "text": "So, we'll see how I feel, you know, if I'm having fun and it's, like, interesting."
  },
  {
   "start": 734.72,
   "end": 736.0,
   "text": "Because I also didn't want to listen to anything."
  },
  {
   "start": 736.08,
   "end": 737.18,
   "text": "My brain was kind of shut down."
  },
  {
   "start": 739.77,
   "end": 747.82,
   "text": "So I'm going to, um, yeah, type this stuff in."
  },
  {
   "start": 748.78,
   "end": 751.28,
   "text": "From this viral, this, uh, Generations page."
  },
  {
   "start": 751.36,
   "end": 751.96,
   "text": "Oh, it's right here."
  },
  {
   "start": 752.98,
   "end": 753.94,
   "text": "This is what I'm talking about."
  },
  {
   "start": 756.22,
   "end": 757.34,
   "text": "I'm going to get that."
  },
  {
   "start": 760.41,
