   "text": "And you can see the page."
  },
  {
   "start": 781.13,
   "end": 781.79,
   "text": "Oh, man."
  },
  {
   "start": 782.97,
   "end": 787.81,
   "text": "And I also have to put the link of, uh, Google Earth Space."
